---
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
const { c, index } = Astro.props;
const d = c.data;                 // { _index, _id, _source }
const src = d._source;
const enrichment = { geo: src.geo, intel: src.intel };
const file = c.data._id;
---
<article class="proof-case" id={c.id}>
  <header class="case-heading">
    <span class="pill">LIVE SIEM 0{index + 1} / {c.label}</span>
    <h2>{c.title}</h2>
    <p class="case-scenario">{c.scenario}</p>
    <div class="case-meta"><span>Live index: <code>{d._index}</code></span><span>Document: <code>{d._id}</code></span></div>
  </header>

  <div class="capture-baseline">
    <span class="eyebrow">SURICATA ALONE</span>
    <strong>{c.left}</strong>
    <span class="capture-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <span class="eyebrow">CERNITY FINDING · IN THE SIEM</span>
    <strong>{c.right}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="record-comparison">
    <section class="record-pane">
      <div class="record-title"><span class="eyebrow">THE ENRICHMENT CERNITY ADDED</span><p>Fields Suricata does not emit — keyed by the endpoint IP</p></div>
      <div class="record-code" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={`${c.label}: enrichment block`}><Code code={JSON.stringify(enrichment, null, 2)} lang="json" theme="github-dark" /></div>
    </section>
    <section class="record-pane">
      <div class="record-title"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT THE SOC ANALYST SEES · LIVE ELASTICSEARCH</span><p>Stored SIEM document — <code>_index</code> / <code>_id</code> / <code>_source</code></p></div>
      <div class="record-code" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={`${c.label}: full SIEM document`}><Code code={JSON.stringify(d, null, 2)} lang="json" theme="github-dark" /></div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="record-caption">
    This is a complete, verbatim document pulled from the live Elasticsearch SIEM (<code>ndr-findings-*</code>) — the real <code>_index</code> and <code>_id</code> are retained so any value traces back to the exact stored record. The escaped <code>entities</code> string is preserved exactly. Nothing was synthesized.
  </div>

  <div class="case-reading">
    <section><h3>Read the record</h3><dl>{c.read.map(([field,meaning])=><div><dt>{field}</dt><dd>{meaning}</dd></div>)}</dl></section>
    <aside class="analyst-notes"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT INVESTIGATION</span><h3>What would you check?</h3><ol>{c.investigation.map(step=><li>{step}</li>)}</ol><details class="knowledge-check"><summary>{c.question}</summary><p>{c.answer}</p></details></aside>
  </div>

  <div class="case-limit"><strong>What this does not establish</strong><p>{c.limit}</p></div>
  <div class="case-download"><a class="text-link" href={`/evidence/enriched-siem/${c.id === 'enriched-long-connection' ? 'long-connection-c2' : 'ndpi-risk-dns'}.json`} download>Download the verbatim SIEM document ↓</a></div>
</article>
